    <body>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-613-879" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-648-841" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-695-799">浪笛兄のふるさとを読み同じ趣向を例の小曲にて試みたるが「都の話」一篇</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-883-906"><seg source="#source-883-906">母は問ふ都の話</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-906-938"><seg source="#source-906-938">馬車、電車、宮城門の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-938-994"><seg source="#source-938-947">楠公の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-947-968"><rb>御像</rb><rt>みぞう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-968-971">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-971-992"><rb>雄姿</rb><rt>ゆうし</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-994-1032"><seg source="#source-994-1032">又問ひぬ、上野パノラマ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1032-1086"><seg source="#source-1032-1041">動物園</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1041-1083"><rb>浅草菩薩</rb><rt>あさくさぼさつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1083-1086">。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
